---
// Masthead drawing: the sun (atom, molecules, antibodies) and the two observers.
// All colors come from CSS variables, so one drawing serves light and dark mode.
// The telescopes lie on rays from the sun's center (20 degrees); keep the three
// <use> positions together if anything here is resized.
